<title>GERMANY: ABB German H1 profit 55 mln DM. [corrected 09:30 gmt]</title>
<headline>ABB German H1 profit 55 mln DM. [corrected 09:30 gmt]</headline>
<dateline>MANNHEIM, Germany 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to June 30 (in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group pretax profit	 55	vs n/a</p>
<p>    Group sales		   3,400   unch</p>
<p>    Group incoming orders     4,500   down five pct (Corrects from up five pct)</p>
<p>NOTE - Asea Brown Boveri AG, the German unit of the Swiss-Swedish engineering group, said developments in the first half of the year were in line with expectations.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-2609750</p>
</text>
